{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Ouch, My Back!"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Baby Split"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Help"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " There are several ways to ask for help in English. You can use polite and casual language to do this. Let's look at one particular structure for asking for help."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the structure<br/> Can/Could + you + show/tell + me + Question word"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Can you show me how to position myself?<br/> Could you tell me where to stand?<br/> Can you tell me how the lessons work?<br/> Could you show me what I have to do?<br/> Can you tell me who that person is?</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can/Could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show/tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Question word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">what</span> time it is, please?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">how</span> to use this?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"show\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">where</span> the washroom is?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">when</span> the next train is?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also use the structure<br/> Let me show/tell + you + question word"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> Let me show you how to get the ice from the drink dispenser. <br/> Let me show you where it is. <br/> Let me tell you what you should do.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Giving Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use modals to give advice. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The most common modals for giving advice are:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can think of modals as \u201chelping verbs\u201d. They add meaning to the main verb of a sentence. In this case, these modals add the meaning of advice. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> Should</span> is the most common modal used to give advice. <br/> <span class=\"italic\"> Ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\"> had better</span>  are used for giving strong advice."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Verb\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"should\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"put\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"some ice on it right away.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ought to \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"put\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"this ice on your thumb.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had better not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"step\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the line.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>In conversation, it is common to use contractions with <span class=\"italic\"> had better</span>. </li></ul><span class=\"italic\">You'd better not step on the line.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "swollen"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "enlarged; puffy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My thumb is quite swollen."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about injuries and accidents."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lump "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bump under the skin, caused by an injury "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think I have a lump on my foot."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bruise "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a black, blue or purple mark on the skin caused by an injury "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You'll definitely have a bruise tomorrow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "whatsoever"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at all (used for emphasis)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "These bowling shoes offer no protection whatsoever!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dispenser"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a machine that gives out a product"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can get ice from the drink dispenser."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "swelling"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an abnormal inflammation of the body"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Put your foot up to reduce the swelling."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob05aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to elevate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to raise"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should elevate your foot."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob05aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le03ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write down 4 injuries on four separate pieces of paper."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your partner will do the same. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you are finished, mix the pieces of paper together. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "C