"id": 0, "image": "engenn7le03ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tHow are your thumb and foot, V?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tNot so good ... my thumb is quite swollen. I think I have a lump on my foot. These bowling shoes offer no protection whatsoever!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tWell, you'll definitely have a nice bruise tomorrow. You should put some ice on it right away.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tIce? Where I am supposed to get ice?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tOk, calm down. I'll be back.", "time": "100", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le03ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tExcuse me, can you show me how to use the ice machine?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: \t\tWow. Nobody ever uses that. Let me show you how to get ice from the drink dispenser.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tThat's a great idea! My friend hurt herself. She dropped a ball on her foot.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: \t\tOuch. Yeah, that hurts. She had better put her foot up to reduce the swelling.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tOk, I'll let her know. Thanks.", "time": "25500", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le03ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tHere, V. You ought to put this ice on your thumb and elevate your foot.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tOk. Your turn to bowl.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tHere goes nothing! Look! A baby split!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: \tCan you tell me what that means?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tIt means that I'll knock all the pins down next ball.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\tWell, good for you. Don't trip!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: \t\tSomeone sounds jealous!", "time": "51000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le03ob05re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosr